      "x": 140,
      "y": 1752,
      "width": 1360,
      "height": 32,
      "text": "Topic-list star spins while a durable job, deferred LOADING_FLAT, RAG, tools, or send RPC is in flight — including the topic you are not looking at.\nDo not abort deferred chatLoadingIds because activeTopicId changed. Hard-cancel only on account mutation + conversationClearGeneration.",
